has real Number
has imaginary Number
constant Zero = Complex(0, 0)
+(other) Complex
	Complex(1, 2) + Complex(3, -1) is Complex(4, 1)
	Complex(real + other.real, imaginary + other.imaginary)
-(other) Complex
	Complex(1, 2) - Complex(3, -1) is Complex(-2, 3)
	Complex(real - other.real, imaginary - other.imaginary)
*(other) Complex
	Complex(1, 2) * Complex(3, -1) is Complex(5, 5)
	Complex(real * other.real - imaginary * other.imaginary, real * other.imaginary + imaginary * other.real)
*(scale Number) Complex
	Complex(1, -2) * 3 is Complex(3, -6)
	Complex(real * scale, imaginary * scale)
Squared Complex
	Complex(1, 2).Squared is Complex(-3, 4)
	Complex(real * real - imaginary * imaginary, 2 * real * imaginary)
SquaredLength Number
	Complex(3, 4).SquaredLength is 25
	real * real + imaginary * imaginary
Length Number
	Complex(3, -4).Length is 5
	SquaredLength.SquareRoot
to Text
	Complex(1.5, -2) to Text is "1.5 - 2i"
	Complex(-1, 0.25) to Text is "-1 + 0.25i"
	(real to Text) + (imaginary < 0 then " - " + -imaginary else " + " + imaginary) + "i"
